<title>UK: BNDES sets 120 mln Swiss franc five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNDES sets 120 mln Swiss franc five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO NACIONAL DE DESENVOLVIMENTO ECONOMICO E SOCIAL</p>
<p> AMT    120 MLN SFR   COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    08.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE    08.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANN</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   NEG PLG   YES	  CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> NOTES	END OF SUBSCRIPTIONS SEPTEMBER 25.</p>
<p>THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
